{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_039_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:adc556862cc86a7dd4574fcf075cf026758bb0eef06e3dd59ab6c03d823c46e2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19a0b4820b527a9c0d6158b3adb875134bc8a3bd5ae3a6b6d7de0ddec55aa2b1",
      "text": "辛苦啦！回事务所之前，\n能稍微借用一下时间吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba48fd396f629552ca46a11f37f195aef4c07eb7832bf3449b9f044d160ac4a9",
      "text": "这个，是白色情人节的礼物。\n请收下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b430cb847f32f847028bc4dd4e1186772e84bcd2327e72c7090bee5f5b38064",
      "text": "收到的巧克力，味道真的超级棒！\n感觉整个人都力量充满啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77bf4f45fdc25d83098d40e9acb96093d7f32d3f5f7aafaeacdd9e44f28bcb7b",
      "text": "回礼也是为了能哪怕还上一点从●●●●●●●●●●师父那里\n收到的力量而挑选的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23ca520417e13919ba12343688741fa40108ae45da70eb9c6e4127d4ac943def",
      "text": "要是能合你心意我就很高兴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ebf210b33519e627b08a69bfed2a017dd32bd6292440e69dbb31c1ddb34c816",
      "text": "原来你在这里啊，●●●●●●●●●●师父。\n能占用你一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f08ff507b85af4a29ec306edbba583430bd2748f30796b23086e3bf1fde8e9d2",
      "text": "这个，请收下！\n是白色情人节的回礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4effaa19eefd49090a0faf5fc4c5eb4aadf7d64f803a9c58825fa05548d691d0",
      "text": "因为想送师父一份最棒的回礼，\n我可是鼓足干劲挑出来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2ae6dc1eea71afc7f60689dbaed87c2ff1cc9d693e112a069fbc9d48da5a237",
      "text": "我想●●●●●●●●●●师父\n也绝对会喜欢的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89ea7cb53f6719d55a84f4c63a97eada9c4366a5362aa9993dedffc5b0efe175",
      "text": "不嫌弃的话希望能收下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_b:cmd-000044:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76f072a8ff3f401435145b506339ec5a89adc4911f0e395c31516cb5f728b05e",
      "text": "能收到这么棒的礼物好开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_b:cmd-000045:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ab6387db521bc9d980d236cf313ea8e70adb27801237ef619b7a3942d27f95c",
      "text": "真的吗？非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53bda8adc1c2a951fd630fee23a290defe89e3b4fa24b308a8280b448535046b",
      "text": "哈哈，你能高兴太好啦！\n里面的东西等会儿再确认吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca10681640bf74411f04622a0068d95e45b3d5ed47a23df2019d754bce551ec2",
      "text": "再次向你道谢，情人节真的非常感谢！\n巧克力也超好吃的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a6c67f7cf245ce309744b3ed0be407e8a316c81e2dd284fa0e49e925d7b63fc",
      "text": "能让●●●●●●●●●●师父开心，\n我自己也超开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca10681640bf74411f04622a0068d95e45b3d5ed47a23df2019d754bce551ec2",
      "text": "再次向你道谢，情人节真的非常感谢！\n巧克力也超好吃的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_039_22:5_02_039_22_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b82faf10c860b02ba158b576a398cbcbb7324c9450aeadb3b2fca71b26fbcea",
      "text": "为了能成为配得上师父这份关怀的偶像，\n今后我也会继续加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
